<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$3 bln in NCDs on Friday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$3 bln in NCDs on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank said on Friday it would issue T$3 billion in 20-day negotiable certificates of deposits later in the day.</p>
<p>Bids will close at 3.00 pm (0700 GMT), a central bank official said.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
